# Normalisasi akhir baris: checkout selalu LF, di Windows maupun Linux.
# Tanpa ini runner CI Windows (core.autocrlf=true) memeriksa file CRLF
# sementara hasil generate memakai LF, sehingga langkah --check gagal.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Biner: jangan disentuh
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.exe  binary
*.dmg  binary
*.AppImage binary
*.zip  binary
